# The sha256 of the released part of CHANGELOG.md (from the first
# `## [x.y.z]` heading down, with the link definitions of released
# versions) as the last commit that edited released text on purpose left
# it. scripts/check_changelog_released.py refuses a commit whose released
# part is not the end of its base's, unless the commit moves this pin to
# the sha256 the refusal prints and its message names this file. A
# release adds a section on top and does not move the pin.
